# =============================================================================
# Postiz - Caddy Configuration for eblej24.com (REFERENCE COPY)
# =============================================================================
# The live route lives in the server platform repo:
#   eblej24-server/config/caddy/Caddyfile
# Caddy does NOT read this file. Keep it in sync with the block there, and edit
# and push eblej24-server when the route needs to change. Do not add the route
# through CaddyManager only: that is how it was lost before (see changelog
# 2026-10-14 in EBLEJ24_MAINTAINER.md).
#
# Services:
#   - social.eblej24.com -> Postiz application (eb24-postiz-app:5000)
#
# Note: Temporal UI is internal-only, accessible via WireGuard VPN
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Postiz - Social Media Scheduler
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Accessible at: https://social.eblej24.com
# Single upstream: nginx inside eb24-postiz-app:5000 routes /api, /uploads and
# the frontend itself. WebSockets are proxied automatically by reverse_proxy.
# `security_headers` is a snippet defined in the eblej24-server Caddyfile.
social.eblej24.com {
	import security_headers

	# Allow large media uploads
	request_body {
		max_size 100MB
	}

	reverse_proxy eb24-postiz-app:5000

	log {
		output stdout
		format console
		level INFO
	}
}
